# ==============================================================================
# Adaptive AI Travel Planner - Environment Configuration (.env)
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Google Gemini API Key (100% FREE Tier)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Where to get it:
# 1. Visit: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (NO credit card required).
# 3. Click "Create API Key" and paste it here:
GEMINI_API_KEY=
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-1.5-flash

# Note: If left blank, the app runs on our deterministic Curated Intelligence Engine
# (realistic Goa itinerary with exact coordinates), so your demo never fails!


# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. MongoDB Atlas Cloud Connection URI (100% FREE M0 Cluster)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Where to get it:
# 1. Visit: https://www.mongodb.com/atlas/database
# 2. Sign up / log in and create a "Free M0" cluster (shared, free forever).
# 3. Under "Security" -> "Database Access": create a user (e.g. travel_admin) with a password.
# 4. Under "Security" -> "Network Access": add IP Address 0.0.0.0/0 (Allow Access from Anywhere).
# 5. Under "Deployment" -> "Database": Click "Connect" -> Choose "Drivers" (Python) -> Copy URI.
#
# Paste your URI here (replace <password> with your actual database user password):
# Example:
# MONGODB_URI=mongodb+srv://travel_admin:MyPassword123@cluster0.abcde.mongodb.net/travel_planner?retryWrites=true&w=majority
MONGODB_URI=
DATABASE_NAME=travel_planner

# Note: If left blank, the app runs on the built-in resilient In-Memory MongoDB engine
# (mongomock), guaranteeing zero-friction local execution!


# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Server Networking Settings
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
HOST=127.0.0.1
PORT=8000
